evidence = "The final hf-done JSON and private evidence ledger name the exact verified content-derived candidate revision, command, exit code and log path; hf-build and hf-done must pass on the same candidate revision. This record is finalized before qualification, because embedding its own candidate hash would change that hash. No success is declared without that gate evidence. The runner records and publishes the candidate; no manual commit or push is performed."
